config RTL8196E_ETH
	tristate "Realtek RTL8196E Ethernet (new, recommended)"
	depends on MIPS && OF && !SMP
	help
	  Clean-room RTL8196E Ethernet driver: single-port, NAPI, zero-copy
	  RX/TX. Replaces the legacy rtl819x SDK port with maintainable code.

	  The lockless ring cursors and bare per-CPU-less counters rely on the
	  single-core (UP) serialization of this SoC; it depends on !SMP so a
	  future multi-core port cannot silently inherit the unsynchronised
	  fast paths.

	  Delivers ~94 Mbps TCP RX and ~73 Mbps TCP TX on the Lexra RLX4181
	  (RTL8196E at 400 MHz). Configured via devicetree (interface@0 node).
